"to modify your answer and press the Enter key to check if you've got it "
"right. If not, just try again."
msgstr ""
"Chì thu ceist toirt air falbh le dà àireamh. Thoir seachad an fhreagairt (an "
"diofar) taobh deas an t-samhla co-ionnanachd. Cleachd na saighdean gus an "
"fhreagairt agad atharrachadh is brùth air an iuchair Enter gus faighinn "
"a-mach a bheil thu ceart. Mur eil, cha leig thu leas ach feuchainn a-rithist."

#: ../src/activities/memory-math-div/ActivityInfo.qml:9
